まだ見えない明日も きらめきに変えてきっと
Even tomorrow which we cannot see yet, turning it into sparkle

739
01:03:37,741 --> 01:03:43,741
僕たちが 未来へと 連れていくから
We will lead you toward the future

740
01:03:50,741 --> 01:03:55,741
背伸びしては手を伸ばす 憧れの
Stretching up and reaching out, our longing

741
01:03:56,741 --> 01:04:00,741
行き先示す星になろう
Let's become the star that shows the way

742
01:04:01,241 --> 01:04:05,741
つまづくその度に 手を差し伸べ合えたら
Every time we stumble, if we reach out our hands to each other

743
01:04:05,741 --> 01:04:11,741
すぐに届くはずさ
We'll surely reach it soon

744
01:04:11,741 --> 01:04:16,741
そっと心とした 小さな勇気が
Gently joining our small courages

745
01:04:16,741 --> 01:04:21,741
もう消えないように繋げよ
Connecting them so they won't fade away

746
01:04:22,241 --> 01:04:27,741
不安も愛しさも 大切に抱きしめて
Embracing both anxiety and affection dearly

747
01:04:27,741 --> 01:04:31,741
共に行くよ 目を合わせて
We'll go together, meeting eyes

748
01:04:31,741 --> 01:04:36,741
舞い散る希望へ 飛び出せるよ
To the scattering hopes, we can burst out

749
01:04:37,241 --> 01:04:44,741
突き抜けていく 僕たちの透き通る決意は
Breaking through, our clear-cut determination

750
01:04:44,741 --> 01:04:48,741
まだまだ止められないよ
Still cannot be stopped

751
01:04:48,741 --> 01:04:54,741
歩き足りない今日こそ ときめきに変えてもっと
Today, which we haven't walked enough of, turning it into excitement

752
01:04:54,741 --> 01:04:59,206
僕たちが いつまでも 背中を押すから
Because we will push your back forever

753
01:05:10,265 --> 01:05:11,965
Wafuu! Hey, we have something we want to share with you.

754
01:05:13,465 --> 01:05:16,965
It's now been 3 years since we made our debut here in hololive.

755
01:05:16,965 --> 01:05:20,365
There's been so many precious memories made, laughed together,

756
01:05:20,365 --> 01:05:24,465
and even some tears, they were precious too.

757
01:05:24,658 --> 01:05:27,958
It's been lots of challenges, but it's all been worth it.

758
01:05:27,958 --> 01:05:32,658
The attitude with dreams we dreamt 3 years ago have been coming true one by one.

759
01:05:32,758 --> 01:05:37,558
And now, our dreams have become our own first live! But our albums coming true too.

760
01:05:37,558 --> 01:05:40,158
Yeah, and my soul is kind of like thankful.

761
01:05:40,208 --> 01:05:43,208
We want to continue on this journey, no matter what comes our way,

762
01:05:43,208 --> 01:05:46,708
as long as we're together, we know that we can do the impossible.

763
01:05:46,708 --> 01:05:50,208
Thank you for being our precious Ruffians, here by our side.

764
01:05:50,208 --> 01:05:53,808
We'll continue to protect your smile forever and ever! Bau Bau!

765
01:05:56,858 --> 01:05:59,858
ずっと一人で描いてた
I'd been drawing it all alone,

766
01:05:59,858 --> 01:06:04,908
いつか誰かがこんな人になって
hoping someday someone would become like this.

767
01:06:04,908 --> 01:06:10,908
少しずつ芽生える大好きを紡ぎ どこまでも熱く
Spinning the growing love little by little, burning endlessly,

768
01:06:11,458 --> 01:06:16,708
明日色の空へ駆け抜けていく
running through toward the sky the color of tomorrow.

769
01:06:16,708 --> 01:06:21,208
僕たちの青春の光は
The light of our youth

770
01:06:21,208 --> 01:06:31,708
誰にも止められないよ
can't be stopped by anyone!

771
01:06:32,208 --> 01:06:36,708
笑い合う分だけ優しく こぼれる涙さえほら
As gentle as we laugh together, even the spilled tears, look,

772
01:06:37,208 --> 01:06:41,708
輝かせて明日へ運ぶから
will shine and carry us to tomorrow.

773
01:06:41,708 --> 01:06:45,208
君の隣へ 僕たちは
By your side, we

774
01:06:45,208 --> 01:06:51,708
世界を超えていく 迎えに行くよ
will cross the world, going to greet you!

775
01:06:52,208 --> 01:06:57,708
まだ見えない明日日も きらめきに変えてきっと
Even tomorrow we can't see yet, turning it into sparkle, surely

776
01:06:58,208 --> 01:07:03,208
僕たちが未来へと
we will take you

777
01:07:03,208 --> 01:07:11,208
果てのない未来へと 連れていくから
to a boundless future!

778
01:07:13,408 --> 01:07:21,208
We're together! FURR-EVER!! It's all thanks to hololive

